{%- comment -%}
  Florista announcement bar.

  Replaces the base theme's stock one, which shipped the English "Welcome to our store" and was removed
  when the header was rebuilt. This one is fully editable and can be switched off without
  touching code — which is the point of it existing rather than being hardcoded copy.

  It scrolls away. The header is sticky, this is not: a strip that permanently eats vertical
  space on a phone costs more than it earns, and a one-line promise is a fact you read once.

  The text is a rich-text setting (since 2026-09-06), not a plain string, so a word inside the
  sentence can carry a link — the owner asked for "משלוחי פרחים בחיפה והסביבה" with "הסביבה"
  pointing at /pages/delivery. Highlight a word in the editor and add the link there; nothing
  in code decides which word it is. The earlier whole-bar "link" setting is gone: a link inside
  a link is invalid HTML, and one way to link is enough.

  NOTE: nothing here computes the time. A live "X hours left until the cutoff" indicator is its
  own brick and needs real logic — Fridays, holiday eves and peak dates all change same-day
  delivery. A static string dressed up as a live countdown becomes a lie the minute it passes.
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- if section.settings.text != blank -%}
  {%- comment -%}
  Inlined rather than linked since 2026-09-05: this is above-the-fold CSS on every page and a
  linked stylesheet here blocked first paint for one extra round trip (Lighthouse
  render-blocking-insight). The file stays in assets/ as the source; nothing else changes.
{%- endcomment -%}
<style>{{ 'florista-announcement.css' | inline_asset_content }}</style>

  <div
    class="fa-bar"
    style="--fa-bg: {{ section.settings.background }}; --fa-fg: {{ section.settings.text_color }};"
  >
    <div class="fa-bar-text">{{ section.settings.text }}</div>
  </div>
{%- endif -%}

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "פס הודעה",
  "settings": [
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "מוצג בראש כל עמוד. השאירו את שדה הטקסט ריק כדי להסתיר אותו לגמרי."
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "text",
      "label": "טקסט",
      "info": "שורה אחת. אפשר לסמן מילה ולהוסיף לה קישור — למשל \"הסביבה\" לעמוד המשלוחים.",
      "default": "<p>משלוחי פרחים בחיפה ו<a href=\"/pages/delivery\">הסביבה</a></p>"
    },
    {
      "type": "color",
      "id": "background",
      "label": "צבע רקע",
      "default": "#8A0040"
    },
    {
      "type": "color",
      "id": "text_color",
      "label": "צבע טקסט",
      "default": "#FFFFFF"
    }
  ],
  "presets": [{ "name": "פס הודעה" }]
}
{% endschema %}
